=== sotruss ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sotruss [OPTION...] [--] EXECUTABLE [EXECUTABLE-OPTION...]


POSITIONALS (2) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  EXECUTABLE
  EXECUTABLE-OPTION...


FLAGS (9) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-F, --from FROMLIST    Trace calls from objects on FROMLIST
-T, --to TOLIST        Trace calls to objects on TOLIST
-e, --exit             Also show exits from the function calls
-f, --follow           Trace child processes
-o, --output FILENAME  Write output to FILENAME (or FILENAME. in case -f is
                       also used) instead of standard error
-?, --help             Give this help list
    --usage            Give a short usage message
    --version          Print program version
--
